id: pm-github-fqjp
title: Use configured lifecycle roles in existing GitHub export and sync mappings
description: "Static follow-up from issue-form integration review: itemToGithubPayload and pmStatusToGithubState currently compare built-in closed/canceled names. Custom terminal statuses can therefore be exported/synced as open. Reproduce with custom active and terminal status registries, then route existing lifecycle mappings through the configured SDK registry roles. The issue-form adapter treats status bindings as literal answers and does not change these legacy mappings."
